{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"Y\",\n    \"small\": \"X\",\n    \"core\": \"平\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\",\n    \"load\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big 判 Y：Y 的大块直接呈现完整的处境、原因和转折，人物的心理变化更容易只靠大字串起来；X 的放大词有时还需要普通字补足关系。small 判 X：X 的补充相对更有变化，也较少在同一屏反复描写相近的感受；Y 的 S01 连续堆叠冷、空、胸紧、眼糊、伸手摸空等体验，S08 也反复表达暖意消退和独自面对难事。core 判平：两版都完整保留了维护尊严与怀念旧日亲近、归属之间反复拉扯的主线，没有明显偏题。concise、human、load 判 X：Y 的感受和旁注重复较多，而且「被当自己人」「怕得等很久」「从前的好一真切起来」等具体表达不够自然；每屏还要扫过多块大字，尤其 S08 的20秒内出现四块大字，负担高于 X。fine 判 Y：Y 对胸口发紧、伸手落空、身体先于意识惊醒等体验描写更具体，有更鲜明的身体感和辨识度。综合来看，Y 的大字叙事和具体感受有优势，但 X 在自然度、简洁度和实际扫屏负担上更稳定。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1ce79b44-6a34-46af-8ad3-cc6efc451f39", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T192740944346Z", "elapsed_seconds": 196.969, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T19:30:57.922539+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ae701814ff77e76ebd6ed461104860fae78694dc1ad0984f44f04e01d8f848ad", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cl